  "description": "GitObjectDb is designed to simplify the configuration management versioning. It does so by removing the need for hand-coding the commands needed to interact with Git. The Git repository is used as a pure database as the files containing the serialized copy of the objects are never fetched in the filesystem. GitObjectDb only uses the blob storage provided by Git.",
